### 11.2 自动开箱

项目里有自动开箱策略：

```ts
useEffect(() => {
  if (type === 'MESSAGE' && !isFlatCar) {
    return;
  }

  if (vehicleName && autoOpen) {
    orderList.forEach(order => {
      if (order.orderStatus !== 'PICKED') {
        handleOpenBox(vehicleName, order.gridNo.split(','), [order.id], true);
      }
